# Regional travel: coastal ferry (after CH06), cable ferry (after CH07). Authored routes, no fuel.
@scene FERRY_BELLHARBOR
if ch:CH06 run
say sailor | The coastal ferry's tied up. Ministry orders: no sailings until the archive business is settled.
end
label run
sfx FX031
choice | Take the ferry north to Skyspine -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The ferry bell rings. The coast slides by, cream stone and bronze bells, until the cliffs rise.
warp WORLD ferry_sky
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_SKYSPINE
if ch:CH06 run
say narr | An empty ferry landing.
end
label run
sfx FX031
choice | Take the ferry south to Bellharbor -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The ferry works down the coast to Bellharbor's quay.
warp WORLD ferry_bh
label stay
@end

@scene CABLE_AERIE
if ch:CH07 run
say narr | The cable ferry across the chasm hangs still. High Aerie's crew hasn't reset the anchors.
end
label run
choice | Ride the cable west to the Pale Basin -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The basket creaks out over the chasm. Salt glitters far below.
warp WORLD cable_nacre
label stay
@end

@scene CABLE_NACRE
if ch:CH07 run
say narr | The basin end of the cable ferry. The basket is on the far side.
end
label run
choice | Ride the cable east to Skyspine -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The basket swings east toward the cliffs.
warp WORLD cable_aerie
label stay
@end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lanternwake (after CH16)
@scene SHIP_BOARD
if phase:post post
choice | Take the helm -> helm | Stay ashore -> stay
goto chosen
label post
choice | Take the helm -> helm | Go below deck -> below | Stay ashore -> stay
label chosen
label helm
airship board
end
label below
airship below
warp W_DECK from_world up
label stay
@end

@scene SHIP_HELM
if phase:post post
choice | Land here -> land | Stay aloft -> stay
goto chosen
label post
choice | Land here -> land | Go below deck -> below | Stay aloft -> stay
label chosen
label land
airship land
end
label below
airship below
warp W_DECK from_world up
label stay
@end

@scene SHIP_RECALL
if phase:post post
say narr | A marked landing field. The Wayfarer can be called down here.
choice | Call the Wayfarer -> call | Not now -> stay
label call
airship recall
say narr | The Wayfarer drifts down onto the field, its envelope creaking.
end
label post
say narr | A marked landing field. Lanternwake can be called down here.
choice | Call Lanternwake -> call2 | Not now -> stay
label call2
airship recall
say narr | Lanternwake settles onto the field, engines ticking as they cool.
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_HEARTHWARD
sfx FX031
choice | Take the ferry back to Hearthward -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The ferry crosses the Ember Sea to Hearthward's pontoons.
warp T07_MARKET from_berth left
label stay
@end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- world v2 crossings
@scene FERRY_BELLHARBOR_POST
sfx FX031
choice | Take the ferry to Bellharbor -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The ferry noses out past the drowned breakwater. Bellharbor's bells are fewer now, and quieter.
warp WORLD_POST ferry_bh
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_KAMINARI
if ch:CH09 run
say sailor | Nobody crosses the strait. The Fox Court turns boats around, and the ones it doesn't, it keeps.
end
label run
sfx FX031
choice | Cross the strait to Vermilion Reach -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | Lanterns drift on the current beside the hull. On the far shore the maples burn red, though it is not autumn.
warp WORLD ferry_kam_e
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_KAMINARI_BACK
sfx FX031
choice | Cross back to the mainland -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The ferryman does not look back at the shore. Neither, after a while, do you.
warp WORLD ferry_kam
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_SALTWHISTLE
if ch:CH05 run
say sailor | Saltwhistle boats only. Come back when the guild's taking passengers.
end
label run
sfx FX031
choice | Sail out to Saltwhistle Isle -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | A fishing smack takes you aboard for a coin and a hand with the nets.
warp WORLD ferry_salt_s
label stay
@end

@scene FERRY_SALTWHISTLE_BACK
sfx FX031
choice | Sail back to the mainland -> go | Stay -> stay
label go
say narr | The smack runs home ahead of the weather, gulls screaming after the catch.
warp WORLD ferry_salt
label stay
@end

@scene CABLE_CHOIR
if phase:post gone
if ch:CH07 run
say narr | The sky cable runs up into the cloud toward Crucible Isle. The basket is chained; the shrine keepers say the line is not yet safe.
end
label run
say narr | The cable to Crucible Isle hums in the wind. A basket swings at the landing, and a board says ARENA - FIGHTERS AND WAGERS.
choice | Ride up to the Crucible Isle -> up | Stay -> stay
label up
sfx FX031
say narr | The basket climbs into the cloud. For a long time there is nothing but white, and the hum of the line.
warp N38_R01 cable right
label stay
end
label gone
say narr | The cable to Crucible Isle ends in a frayed stump. The fault snapped it. Only an airship can reach the isle now.
@end
